    },
    {
      "id": "vblA",
      "code_hash": "7e0149df90de6794f2c46541d24c3da8",
      "outputs": [
        {
          "type": "data",
          "data": {
            "text/markdown": "<span class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents\"><h1 id=\"scalable-postselection-the-game\">Scalable Postselection: The Game</h1>\n<span class=\"paragraph\"><em>Based on <a href=\"https://arxiv.org/abs/2603.08697\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Staples, Fu &amp; Thompson \u2014 Scalable Postselection of Quantum Resources</a></em></span>\n<span class=\"paragraph\">You are the <strong>classical decoder</strong> of a fault-tolerant quantum computer.\nNoisy resource states stream through your teleportation pipeline.\nYour mission: <strong>accept</strong> safe states, <strong>reject</strong> dangerous ones, and\n<strong>minimize total spacetime overhead</strong>.</span>\n<span class=\"paragraph\">The boundary stabilizers are <em>unmeasured</em> \u2014 hidden under a fog of war.\nYou must decide using only the <strong>visible bulk syndrome</strong>.</span>\n<hr />\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>Symbol</th>\n<th>Meaning</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><marimo-tex class=\"arithmatex\">||(d||)</marimo-tex></td>\n<td>Code distance (lattice size)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><marimo-tex class=\"arithmatex\">||(p||)</marimo-tex></td>\n<td>Physical error rate per qubit</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><marimo-tex class=\"arithmatex\">||(\\sigma_v||)</marimo-tex></td>\n<td>Visible (bulk) syndrome \u2014 defects you can see</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><marimo-tex class=\"arithmatex\">||(\\sigma_h||)</marimo-tex></td>\n<td>Hidden (boundary) syndrome \u2014 concealed by fog of war</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><marimo-tex class=\"arithmatex\">||(G_A||)</marimo-tex></td>\n<td><strong>Apparent gap</strong> \u2014 decoder confidence from visible info only</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><marimo-tex class=\"arithmatex\">||(G_P||)</marimo-tex></td>\n<td><strong>Partial gap</strong> \u2014 expected confidence averaging over boundary uncertainty</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><marimo-tex class=\"arithmatex\">||(C(d) = d^3||)</marimo-tex></td>\n<td>Base cost per resource state</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table></span>"
          }
        }
      ],
      "console": []
    },
